872", "start": 142, "url": "https://t.co/ygKvqmFi0K"}]}, "id": "2115798012706639936", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 10703, "like_count": 54, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 18, "retweet_count": 9}, "text": "AI-driven inflation eased in September, contributing just 0.82bps to headline PCE #inflation, down from December’s peak of 4.60bps @economics https://t.co/ygKvqmFi0K", "url": "https://x.com/LizAnnSonders/status/2115798012706639936"}, {"author_id": "702235316812275712", "created_at": "2026-10-29T13:20:07.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115795819454718348"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 66, "id": "2323172244", "start": 58, "username": "tmahedy"}], "urls": [{"description": "My raw, unfiltered, GIF-filled, salty hot take on what happened at today’s press conference. Sensibilities beware.", "display_url": "accessmacro.substack.com/p/way-too-earl…", "end": 92, "expanded_url": "https://accessmacro.substack.com/p/way-too-early-takes-on-the-october?r=2wn1yx&utm_campaign=post&utm_medium=web", "images": [{"height": 800, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2115795820008370176/Xa-CF8nm?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1600}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2115795820008370176/Xa-CF8nm?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 69, "status": 200, "title": "Way Too Early Takes on the October FOMC Meeting", "unwound_url": "https://accessmacro.substack.com/p/way-too-early-takes-on-the-october?r=2wn1yx&utm_campaign=post&utm_medium=web", "url": "https://t.co/VvsBxGvoI9"}]}, "id": "2115795819454718348", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1193, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "GIF-infused FOMC hot takes from my Access/Macro colleague @tmahedy \n\nhttps://t.co/VvsBxGvoI9", "url": "https://x.com/EconBerger/status/2115795819454718348"}, {"author_id": "2961589380", "created_at": "2026-10-29T13:18:16.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115795355233362199"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/x4PBQWp4JV", "end": 282, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/LizAnnSonders/status/2115795355233362199/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115795347813421056", "start": 259, "url": "https://t.co/x4PBQWp4JV"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/x4PBQWp4JV", "end": 282, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/LizAnnSonders/status/2115795355233362199/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115795347838562304", "start": 259, "url": "https://t.co/x4PBQWp4JV"}]}, "id": "2115795355233362199", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 10712, "like_count": 33, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 11, "retweet_count": 7}, "text": "Initial jobless claims up to 194k vs. 198k est. &amp; 195k prior; continuing claims at 1.701M vs. 1.720M est. &amp; 1.722M prior … greatest increases in  NY (+2.9k), CA (+1.4k), &amp; TX (+1.3k); greatest decreases in MI (-1.8k), TN (-1.0k), &amp; KY (-0.5k) https://t.co/x4PBQWp4JV", "url": "https://x.com/LizAnnSonders/status/2115795355233362199"}, {"author_id": "14096763", "created_at": "2026-10-29T12:59:25.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115790610125013125"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 76, "id": "1622260212798291972", "start": 61, "username": "chameleon_jeff"}], "urls": [{"description": "Podcast Episode · Odd Lots · October 15 · 58m", "display_url": "podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/jef…", "end": 100, "expanded_url": "https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/jeff-yans-plan-to-bring-the-entire-financial-industry/id1056200096?i=1000796459553", "images": [{"height": 1200, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2115790615321714688/tHzVKQCj?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1200}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2115790615321714688/tHzVKQCj?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 77, "status": 200, "title": "Jeff Yan's Plan to Bring the Entire Financial Industry Onto Hyperliquid", "unwound_url": "https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/jeff-yans-plan-to-bring-the-entire-financial-industry/id1056200096?i=1000796459553", "url": "https://t.co/RuIhGZPJPP"}]}, "id": "2115790610125013125", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 30, "impression_count": 15082, "like_count": 207, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 7, "retweet_count": 12}, "text": "May be a good time to go back and listen to our episode with @chameleon_jeff https://t.co/RuIhGZPJPP", "url": "https://x.com/TheStalwart/status/2115790610125013125"}, {"author_id": "2961589380", "created_at": "2026-10-29T12:55:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115789639919579526"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/auSPes7sP1", "end": 280, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/LizAnnSonders/status/2115789639919579526/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115789635938844673", "start": 257, "url": "https://t.co/auSPes7sP1"}]}, "id": "2115789639919579526", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 5, "impression_count": 10739, "like_count": 51, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 27, "retweet_count": 6}, "text": "GDP’s components … another strong Q for capex (nonresidential fixed investment), but continues to be somewhat offset by a drag from net exports (AI buildout is very import-driven, which doesn’t accrue to benefit of GDP … remember the D stands for domestic) https://t.co/auSPes7sP1", "url": "https://x.com/LizAnnSonders/status/2115789639919579526"}, {"author_id": "2961589380", "created_at": "2026-10-29T12:53:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115789065286979756"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/0k64alk0aa", "end": 167, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/LizAnnSonders/status/2115789065286979756/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115789058525765633", "start": 144, "url": "https://t.co/0k64alk0aa"}]}, "id": "2115789065286979756", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 11183, "like_count": 59, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 23, "retweet_count": 9}, "text": "Advance estimate for 3Q2026 GDP +3.4% (q/q ann.) vs. +3.2% est. &amp; +2.2% prior … personal consumption +3.8% vs. +3.4% est. &amp; +3.8% prior https://t.co/0k64alk0aa", "url": "https://x.com/LizAnnSonders/status/2115789065286979756"}, {"author_id": "2961589380", "created_at": "2026-10-29T12:52:38.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115788904326652186"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/p65HzjXdBv", "end": 193, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/LizAnnSonders/status/2115788904326652186/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115788899972710400", "start": 170, "url": "https://t.co/p65HzjXdBv"}]}, "id": "2115788904326652186", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 9932, "like_count": 32, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 10, "retweet_count": 6}, "text": "September personal income +0.2% m/m vs. +0.3% est. &amp; +0.3% prior … personal spending +0.5% vs. +0.6% est. &amp; +0.9% prior (another month with spending &gt; income) https://t.co/p65HzjXdBv", "url": "https://x.com/LizAnnSonders/status/2115788904326652186"}, {"author_id": "2961589380", "created_at": "2026-10-29T12:51:39.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115788655411515744"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 24, "start": 14, "tag": "inflation"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/3HwYLdK9qU", "end": 157, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/LizAnnSonders/status/2115788655411515744/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115788650801676288", "start": 134, "url": "https://t.co/3HwYLdK9qU"}]}, "id": "2115788655411515744", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 15409, "like_count": 66, "quote_count": 4, "reply_count": 15, "retweet_count": 11}, "text": "September PCE #inflation (blue) +3.6% y/y vs. +3.6% est. &amp; +3.4% prior … core PCE (orange) +3.1% vs. +3.1% est. &amp; +3.0% prior https://t.co/3HwYLdK9qU", "url": "https://x.com/LizAnnSonders/status/2115788655411515744"}, {"author_id": "2961589380", "created_at": "2026-10-29T12:51:13.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115788544652542124"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 24, "start": 14, "tag": "inflation"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/uBngMYwJFr", "end": 137, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/LizAnnSonders/status/2115788544652542124/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115788540478963712", "start": 114, "url": "https://t.co/uBngMYwJFr"}]}, "id": "2115788544652542124", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 10280, "like_count": 36, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 13, "retweet_count": 6}, "text": "September PCE #inflation +0.5% m/m vs. +0.5% est. vs. +0.3% prior … core PCE +0.3% vs. +0.3% est. vs. +0.3% prior https://t.co/uBngMYwJFr", "url": "https://x.com/LizAnnSonders/status/2115788544652542124"}, {"author_id": "14096763", "created_at": "2026-10-29T12:44:21.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115786817509249341"], "entities": {"cashtags": [{"end": 5, "start": 0, "tag": "HYPE"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/SjWSNU9NDS", "end": 41, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/TheStalwart/status/2115786817509249341/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115786808239804417", "start": 18, "url": "https://t.co/SjWSNU9NDS"}]}, "id": "2115786817509249341", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 6, "impression_count": 24053, "like_count": 278, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 29, "retweet_count": 15}, "text": "$HYPE is surging. https://t.co/SjWSNU9NDS", "url": "https://x.com/TheStalwart/status/2115786817509249341"}, {"author_id": "702235316812275712", "created_at": "2026-10-29T12:42:22.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115786319532274082"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/WdRZWUU4v9", "end": 272, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/EconBerger/status/2115786319532274082/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115786072508792832", "start": 249, "url": "https://t.co/WdRZWUU4v9"}]}, "id": "2115786319532274082", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 1824, "like_count": 13, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 6, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "Claims:\n\n1/ Initial claims (and layoffs) are really low.  They may even be falling further from those really low levels, though it's a little hard to tell.\n\n(And would buck the slightly 